# Functions the JIT is expected to leave to the interpreter: file|function.
# Anything else rejected by the JIT fails scripts/jit-bails.ps1.
# Functions that use dynamic operations with no portable SSA form are
# accepted everywhere and need no entry here.
jit-optional-chains.test.vn|ocOn
jit-optional-chains.test.vn|<closure>
large-module-compiles.test.vn|<module>
